@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

<http://cmt#Conference> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Conference> .

<http://cmt#ConferenceChair> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Conference_part> .

<http://cmt#ConferenceMember> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Conference_fees> .

<http://cmt#Meta-Reviewer> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Reviewer> .

<http://cmt#Paper> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Paper> .

<http://cmt#PaperAbstract> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Paper> .

<http://cmt#Person> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Person> .

<http://cmt#Preference> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Review_preference> .

<http://cmt#ProgramCommittee> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Program_committee> .

<http://cmt#ProgramCommitteeChair> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Program_committee> .

<http://cmt#ProgramCommitteeMember> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Program_committee> .

<http://cmt#Review> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Review> .

<http://cmt#Reviewer> owl:equivalentClass <http://conference#Reviewer> .

<http://cmt#email> owl:equivalentProperty <http://conference#has_an_email> .

<http://cmt#hasBeenAssigned> owl:equivalentProperty <http://conference#has_been_assigned_a_review_reference> .

<http://cmt#hasProgramCommitteeMember> owl:equivalentProperty <http://conference#has_a_program_committee> .

<http://cmt#memberOfProgramCommittee> owl:equivalentProperty <http://conference#was_a_program_committee_of> .

<http://cmt#name> owl:equivalentProperty <http://conference#has_a_name> .

<http://cmt#reviewsPerPaper> owl:equivalentProperty <http://conference#reviews> .

